    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "A custom compositor can output spatial video by specifying one of these spatial configurations.",
      "ko": "delegate 객체는 [`AVAudioSessionDelegate`](avaudiosessiondelegate.md)에 설명된 프로토콜을 구현해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "842d6deace85c3681570180162a3a33b6013e158230c4abc460745fcfdd1e4a9",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "A spatial configuration with all nil values indicates the video is not spatial.",
      "ko": "이 메서드는 로딩 요청을 완료로 표시하고, 해당 리소스를 로드할 수 없음을 리소스 로더 객체에 알립니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4e22358c07d403d7e7b46653cc030b9e75cec43d9fb4165c1b4abce0f324b642",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "A nil spatial configuration also indicates the video is not spatial.",
      "ko": "GDC를 사용하면 기기가 보정된 이미지를 원래 이미지 크기로 업스케일링합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d81450c2366cb4171cedf6832fde0bacab033a459b96972933675180c89e2a82",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0004",
      "source": "The value can be nil, which indicates the output will not be spatial.",
      "ko": "The value can be nil, which indicates the output will not be spatial.",
      "sourceHash": "bcd8d9bddc243400ba779fe8a01ebfd7821ab5c0128b8da5d9b55a4e6fe7183b",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0005",
      "source": "NOTE: If this property is not empty, then the client must attach one of the spatial configurations in this array to all of the pixel buffers, otherwise an exception will be thrown.",
      "ko": "NOTE: If this property is not empty, then the client must attach one of the spatial configurations in this array to all of the pixel buffers, otherwise an exception will be thrown.",
      "sourceHash": "69c35fc0b9d0452ba03c3fb998b1463f61ceb569449bdb0374bd7cfc0f412965",
      "status": "failed"
